{"no":86,"name":"سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ","enName":"At-Taariq","enNameTranslation":"The Morning Star","bnNameTranslation":"আত তারিক","revelationType":"Meccan","revelationOrder":36,"numberOfAyahs":17,"verses":[{"totalNumber":5932,"numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَالسَّمَاءِ وَالطَّارِقِ","enText":"By the sky and the night comer -","enTextTransliteration":"Wassamaaa'i wattaariq","bnText":"শপথ আকাশের এবং রাত্রিতে আগমনকারীর।","bntextLatin":"Sapatha akasera ebam ratrite agamanakarira."}},{"totalNumber":5933,"numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا الطَّارِقُ","enText":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","enTextTransliteration":"Wa maaa adraaka mattaariq","bnText":"আপনি জানেন, যে রাত্রিতে আসে সেটা কি","bntextLatin":"Apani janena, ye ratrite ase seta ki"}},{"totalNumber":5934,"numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"النَّجْمُ الثَّاقِبُ","enText":"It is the piercing star -","enTextTransliteration":"Annajmus saaqib","bnText":"সেটা এক উজ্জ্বল নক্ষত্র।","bntextLatin":"seta eka ujjbala naksatra."}},{"totalNumber":5935,"numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ","enText":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","enTextTransliteration":"In kullu nafsil lammaa 'alaihaa haafiz","bnText":"প্রত্যেকের উপর একজন তত্ত্বাবধায়ক রয়েছে।","bntextLatin":"Pratyekera upara ekajana tattbabadhayaka rayeche."}},{"totalNumber":5936,"numberInSurah":5,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"فَلْيَنظُرِ الْإِنسَانُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","enText":"So let man observe from what he was created.","enTextTransliteration":"Fal yanzuril insaanu mimma khuliq","bnText":"অতএব, মানুষের দেখা উচিত কি বস্তু থেকে সে সৃজিত হয়েছে।","bntextLatin":"Ata'eba, manusera dekha ucita ki bastu theke se srjita hayeche."}},{"totalNumber":5937,"numberInSurah":6,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّاءٍ دَافِقٍ","enText":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","enTextTransliteration":"Khuliqa mim maaa'in daafiq","bnText":"সে সৃজিত হয়েছে সবেগে স্খলিত পানি থেকে।","bntextLatin":"Se srjita hayeche sabege skhalita pani theke."}},{"totalNumber":5938,"numberInSurah":7,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"يَخْرُجُ مِن بَيْنِ الصُّلْبِ وَالتَّرَائِبِ","enText":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","enTextTransliteration":"Yakhruju mim bainissulbi wat taraaa'ib","bnText":"এটা নির্গত হয় মেরুদন্ড ও বক্ষপাজরের মধ্য থেকে।","bntextLatin":"Eta nirgata haya merudanda o baksapajarera madhya theke."}},{"totalNumber":5939,"numberInSurah":8,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"إِنَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِ لَقَادِرٌ","enText":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able.","enTextTransliteration":"Innahoo 'alaa raj'ihee laqaadir","bnText":"নিশ্চয় তিনি তাকে ফিরিয়ে নিতে সক্ষম।","bntextLatin":"Niscaya tini take phiriye nite saksama."}},{"totalNumber":5940,"numberInSurah":9,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى السَّرَائِرُ","enText":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","enTextTransliteration":"Yawma tublas saraaa'ir","bnText":"যেদিন গোপন বিষয়াদি পরীক্ষিত হবে","bntextLatin":"Yedina gopana bisayadi pariksita habe"}},{"totalNumber":5941,"numberInSurah":10,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"فَمَا لَهُ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ","enText":"Then man will have no power or any helper.","enTextTransliteration":"Famaa lahoo min quwwatinw wa laa naasir","bnText":"সেদিন তার কোন শক্তি থাকবে না এবং সাহায্যকারীও থাকবে না।","bntextLatin":"Sedina tara kona sakti thakabe na ebam sahayyakari'o thakabe na."}},{"totalNumber":5942,"numberInSurah":11,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَالسَّمَاءِ ذَاتِ الرَّجْعِ","enText":"By the sky which returns [rain]","enTextTransliteration":"Wassamaaa'i zaatir raj'","bnText":"শপথ চক্রশীল আকাশের","bntextLatin":"Sapatha cakrasila akasera"}},{"totalNumber":5943,"numberInSurah":12,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَالْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ الصَّدْعِ","enText":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,","enTextTransliteration":"Wal ardi zaatis sad'","bnText":"এবং বিদারনশীল পৃথিবীর","bntextLatin":"ebam bidaranasila prthibira"}},{"totalNumber":5944,"numberInSurah":13,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"إِنَّهُ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ","enText":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,","enTextTransliteration":"Innahoo laqawlun fasl","bnText":"নিশ্চয় কোরআন সত্য-মিথ্যার ফয়সালা।","bntextLatin":"niscaya kora'ana satya-mithyara phayasala."}},{"totalNumber":5945,"numberInSurah":14,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَمَا هُوَ بِالْهَزْلِ","enText":"And it is not amusement.","enTextTransliteration":"Wa maa huwa bil hazl","bnText":"এবং এটা উপহাস নয়।","bntextLatin":"Ebam eta upahasa naya."}},{"totalNumber":5946,"numberInSurah":15,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا","enText":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","enTextTransliteration":"Innahum yakeedoona kaidaa","bnText":"তারা ভীষণ চক্রান্ত করে","bntextLatin":"Tara bhisana cakranta kare"}},{"totalNumber":5947,"numberInSurah":16,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا","enText":"But I am planning a plan.","enTextTransliteration":"Wa akeedu kaidaa","bnText":"আর আমিও কৌশল করি।","bntextLatin":"ara ami'o kausala kari."}},{"totalNumber":5948,"numberInSurah":17,"juz":30,"sajda":{"recommended":false,"obligatory":false},"text":{"arText":"فَمَهِّلِ الْكَافِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًا","enText":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","enTextTransliteration":"Famahhilil kaafireena amhilhum ruwaidaa","bnText":"অতএব, কাফেরদেরকে অবকাশ দিন, তাদেরকে অবকাশ দিন, কিছু দিনের জন্যে।","bntextLatin":"Ata'eba, kapheraderake abakasa dina, taderake abakasa dina, kichu dinera jan'ye."}}]}